############################
# MentalBERT model must NOT live in the repo - live code reads it exclusively
# from ~/.federated/models/mentalbert (see setup/README.md). A broken
# submodule gitlink (no content, no .gitmodules) was found and removed from
# this exact path during the friend-snapshot handoff (2026-09-22) - ignored
# here so it can't be accidentally re-added the same way.
############################
installer/runtime/models/mentalbert/

